var e={tool:`dumpcap from Wireshark`,download:`https://www.wireshark.org/download.html`,guide:`https://wiki.wireshark.org/CaptureSetup/CapturePrivileges`,setup:{windows:`Install dumpcap and Npcap. Choose capture permissions.`,darwin:`Install Wireshark and ChmodBPF.`,linux:`Install dumpcap and configure capture-group access.`},afterSetup:`Open Live capture to check interfaces and permissions, or read a capture file offline.`,notes:[`Capture requires installed dumpcap and OS permission; ProtoPeek does not install drivers or request elevation.`,`Packet-file reading is core; payload reconstruction is opt-in. Captured addresses and payloads can be private.`]};export{e as default};